{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "lot_developer_object_positions",
  "spec": ["lot-developer 17.6", "lot-developer 16"],
  "description": "Test 35 (§17.6 worked example 4). Lot (10, 20, 11, 21), cell width 16: c0 = (160, 320), c1 = (192, 352). A prop (type 1) at (8, 0.5, 4), orientation byte 1, footprint min (6, 2), max (10, 6); no flag bit 0, no foundation, terrain flat at 50. Slot 39 gives, by facing: 0 -> (184, 50.5, 348) orient 1; 1 -> (164, 50.5, 344) 2; 2 -> (168, 50.5, 324) 3; 3 -> (188, 50.5, 328) 0; f = 5 -> pos.x = pos.z = 0, orientation (1 + 5) mod 4 = 2 (the ground y of types 1, 2, 4 is terrain.GetAltitude(pos.x, pos.z)). The same object as type 0 with f = 2 has R = (166, 322, 170, 326): slot 16 (highest, withWater = the configuration's water compatibility) samples no interior vertex and the edge points x = 166, 170 / z = 322, 326; with GetAltitude(170, 326) = 60 it gives 60.5, and with a water-compatible configuration and GetWaterLevel(170, 326) = 70, 70.5. A base texture (type 2) at ox = 20.5, oz = 7.25 with f = 2 snaps to (24, 8) and lands at (184, ., 328). A lot with flag bit 0 and altitude 77 gives pos.y = 77.5 for every object type; with no flag bit 0 but a lot foundation, the foundation occupant's position y. Slot 40 GetPositionForBuilding is slot 39 on the configuration's primary building object, and EAX 0 with nothing written when the lot has no configuration or the configuration no primary object (LD-Q5). The returned EAX of slot 39 (the address of the orient argument) is an interface property, checked by the plugin's ctest.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "ldev_terrain", "flat": 50},
    {"op": "ldev_cfg", "id": 9, "w": 2, "h": 2, "water": false},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "x": 10, "z": 20, "w": 2, "h": 2, "state": 3, "cfg": 9, "facing": 0, "flags": 0},
    {"op": "ldev_create", "seed": 12345},
    {"op": "ldev_init", "expect": true},

    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9,
      "object": {"type": 1, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1, "footprint_min": [6, 2], "footprint_max": [10, 6]},
      "expect": {"pos": [184, 50.5, 348], "orient": 1}},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "facing": 1},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9,
      "object": {"type": 1, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1, "footprint_min": [6, 2], "footprint_max": [10, 6]},
      "expect": {"pos": [164, 50.5, 344], "orient": 2}},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "facing": 2},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9,
      "object": {"type": 1, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1, "footprint_min": [6, 2], "footprint_max": [10, 6]},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 50.5, 324], "orient": 3}},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "facing": 3},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9,
      "object": {"type": 1, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1, "footprint_min": [6, 2], "footprint_max": [10, 6]},
      "expect": {"pos": [188, 50.5, 328], "orient": 0}},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "facing": 5},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9,
      "object": {"type": 1, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1, "footprint_min": [6, 2], "footprint_max": [10, 6]},
      "expect": {"pos": [0, 50.5, 0], "orient": 2}},

    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "facing": 2},
    {"op": "ldev_terrain", "pos": [[170, 326, 60]]},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9,
      "object": {"type": 1, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1, "footprint_min": [6, 2], "footprint_max": [10, 6]},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 50.5, 324], "orient": 3}, "note": "type 1: GetAltitude(168, 324) only"},
    {"op": "ldev_world", "trace_terrain": true},
    {"op": "ldev_clear_events"},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9,
      "object": {"type": 0, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1, "footprint_min": [6, 2], "footprint_max": [10, 6]},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 60.5, 324], "orient": 3}, "note": "type 0: slot 16 over R = (166, 322, 170, 326), highest"},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "alt_vertex"}, "count": 0},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "alt_at"}, "count": 8},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "water_at"}, "count": 0},
    {"op": "ldev_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "alt_at", "x": 170, "z": 326}, "count": 2},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9,
      "object": {"type": 3, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1, "footprint_min": [6, 2], "footprint_max": [10, 6]},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 60.5, 324], "orient": 3}, "note": "type 3 also uses slot 16"},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9,
      "object": {"type": 5, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1, "footprint_min": [6, 2], "footprint_max": [10, 6]},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 60.5, 324], "orient": 3}, "note": "type 5 also uses slot 16"},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9,
      "object": {"type": 4, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1, "footprint_min": [6, 2], "footprint_max": [10, 6]},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 50.5, 324], "orient": 3}, "note": "type 4: GetAltitude"},
    {"op": "ldev_world", "trace_terrain": false},
    {"op": "ldev_terrain", "water_pos": [[170, 326, 70]]},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9,
      "object": {"type": 0, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1, "footprint_min": [6, 2], "footprint_max": [10, 6]},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 60.5, 324], "orient": 3}, "note": "not water-compatible: the water level is not read"},
    {"op": "ldev_cfg", "id": 9, "water": true},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9,
      "object": {"type": 0, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1, "footprint_min": [6, 2], "footprint_max": [10, 6]},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 70.5, 324], "orient": 3}, "note": "water-compatible: slot 16 with water"},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": null,
      "object": {"type": 0, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1, "footprint_min": [6, 2], "footprint_max": [10, 6]},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 60.5, 324], "orient": 3}, "note": "a null configuration: w = false"},
    {"op": "ldev_cfg", "id": 9, "water": false},

    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9,
      "object": {"type": 2, "offset": [20.5, 0, 7.25], "orientation": 0},
      "expect": {"pos": [184, 50, 328], "orient": 2}, "note": "a base texture snaps to the centre of lot cell (1, 0)"},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9,
      "object": {"type": 2, "offset": [-3, 0, 31.9], "orientation": 0},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 50, 344], "orient": 2}, "note": "trunc toward zero: -3 / 16 -> 0, 31.9 / 16 -> 1"},

    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "flags": 1, "altitude": 77},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9, "object": {"type": 0, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 77.5, 324], "orient": 3}},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9, "object": {"type": 1, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 77.5, 324], "orient": 3}},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9, "object": {"type": 2, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 77.5, 328], "orient": 3}},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9, "object": {"type": 4, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 77.5, 324], "orient": 3}},

    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "flags": 2},
    {"op": "ldev_occ", "id": 70, "foundation_kind": 2, "cells": [10, 20, 11, 21], "bbox": [[160, 80, 320], [192, 90, 352]],
      "position": [176, 90, 336]},
    {"op": "ldev_object_position", "lot": 1, "cfg": 9, "object": {"type": 1, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1},
      "expect": {"pos": [168, 90.5, 324], "orient": 3}, "note": "no flag bit 0: the lot foundation's y"},
    {"op": "ldev_occ", "id": 70, "cells": [40, 40, 40, 40], "bbox": [[640, 80, 640], [656, 90, 656]]},

    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 1, "flags": 0, "facing": 0},
    {"op": "ldev_cfg", "id": 9, "primary_building": {"type": 0, "offset": [8, 0.5, 4], "orientation": 1,
      "footprint_min": [6, 2], "footprint_max": [10, 6]}},
    {"op": "ldev_position_for_building", "lot": 1, "expect": {"pos": [184, 50.5, 348], "orient": 1},
      "note": "slot 40 -> slot 39; f = 0: R = (182, 346, 186, 350) does not reach (170, 326)"},
    {"op": "ldev_terrain", "reset": true},
    {"op": "ldev_position_for_building", "lot": 1, "expect": {"pos": [184, 50.5, 348], "orient": 1}},
    {"op": "ldev_cfg", "id": 9, "primary_building": null},
    {"op": "ldev_position_for_building", "lot": 1, "expect": null},
    {"op": "ldev_lot", "id": 2, "x": 30, "z": 30, "state": 1},
    {"op": "ldev_position_for_building", "lot": 2, "expect": null, "note": "no configuration"}
  ]
}
